<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Detailed explanations of Figure <a href="#S1.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ Language Models Do Not Follow Occam’s Razor: A Benchmark for Inductive and Abductive Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we list proof trees for each observation in Figure <a href="#S1.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ Language Models Do Not Follow Occam’s Razor: A Benchmark for Inductive and Abductive Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Hypotheses are in <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">green</span> and world model axioms are in <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;">purple</span>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Fae is strong</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.Ex2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">
<span id="A1.Ex2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_markedasmath ltx_align_bottom">
<span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_bottom"> <span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1.m1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\color[rgb]{0.55,0.14,1}\forall x(\texttt{tiger}(x)\to\texttt{strong}(x))}\mathstrut" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#8C24FF">tiger</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#8C24FF">strong</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\color[rgb]{0.55,0.14,1}\forall x(\texttt{tiger}(x)\to\texttt{strong}(x))}\mathstrut</annotation></semantics></math></span><span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1.m1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 8.00003pt{\color[rgb]{0,0.6,0}\texttt{tiger}(\texttt{Fae})}\mathstrut" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#009900">tiger</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" mathcolor="#009900" stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#009900">Fae</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" mathcolor="#009900" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 8.00003pt{\color[rgb]{0,0.6,0}\texttt{tiger}(\texttt{Fae})}\mathstrut</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:1.7pt;"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:178.7pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_bottom">       <span id="A1.Ex2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1.m1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\texttt{strong}(\texttt{Fae})\mathstrut" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">strong</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">Fae</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\texttt{strong}(\texttt{Fae})\mathstrut</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Fae is not slow</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-28.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_bottom">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_bottom">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall x(\texttt{tiger}(x)\rightarrow\texttt{feline}(x))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#8C24FF">tiger</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#8C24FF">feline</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall x(\texttt{tiger}(x)\rightarrow\texttt{feline}(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text">   </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall x(\texttt{feline}(x)\rightarrow\neg\texttt{slow}(x))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#8C24FF">feline</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" rspace="0.167em">¬</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#8C24FF">slow</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#8C24FF;" mathcolor="#8C24FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall x(\texttt{feline}(x)\rightarrow\neg\texttt{slow}(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span></span>
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:261.1pt;"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:261.1pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">       <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall x(\texttt{tiger}(x)\rightarrow\neg\texttt{slow}(x))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">tiger</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">¬</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">slow</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall x(\texttt{tiger}(x)\rightarrow\neg\texttt{slow}(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span></span>
</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text">   </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{tiger}(\texttt{Fae})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#009900">tiger</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" mathcolor="#009900" stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#009900">Fae</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;" mathcolor="#009900" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{tiger}(\texttt{Fae})</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span></span>
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">       <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:262.9pt;"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:262.9pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">                  <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\neg\texttt{slow}(\texttt{Fae})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">¬</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">slow</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Fae</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\neg\texttt{slow}(\texttt{Fae})</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span></span>
</span></span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Fae is warm-blooded</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:382.6pt;height:70.5pt;vertical-align:-33.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-63.8pt,11.8pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-42.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_bottom">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_bottom">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_bottom">
