<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Sam is hairy</h5>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-14.8pt;">
