<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">        <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:240.0pt;"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:240.0pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span></span>
