<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>Generate a reason example</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">

<div id="alg2.4.1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
              // First, build the ontology tree

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
              // <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Node()" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Node()</annotation></semantics></math> will initialize a node object

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
              // Add a root node

