<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>More results</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we list the absolute results of Figure <a href="#S4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 4.3 Does in-context learning help? ‣ 4 Results ‣ Language Models Do Not Follow Occam’s Razor: A Benchmark for Inductive and Abductive Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> in Figure <a href="#A4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix D More results ‣ Language Models Do Not Follow Occam’s Razor: A Benchmark for Inductive and Abductive Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F5" class="ltx_figure">
